OL,3,GNEWSAThe volunteers 'preserving the
OL,4,Apast' at the side of the road
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the early 2000s some of the phone
OL,7,Fboxes were handed over to the local
OL,8,Fcouncil, while many more were
OL,9,Fdisconnected and decommissioned.
